# Task Management

Canonical rule lives in `haderach-tasks/.cursor/rules/todo-conventions.mdc`.
Read that file for the full policy.

**Local defaults:** When creating a task from this repo, write it to
`../haderach-tasks/tasks/` and set `group: agent`. File bugs in
`../haderach-tasks/tasks/bugs/`. When reading tasks for this repo, prefer items
with `group: agent` or clearly agent-related work.
